     A* Positional column boundaries for a DDS logical file.
     A* Member: LFCOL   Compilable: yes (CRTLF, given PERSON)
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS for physical and logical files
     A*   ibm.com/docs/en/i/7.5?topic=files-dds-physical-logical
     A* Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
     A* col 17 name type. R record, K key, J join, S select, O omit.
00010A          R PERSFMT                   PFILE(PERSON)
     A* a field with no attributes inherits them from the based-on file
00020A            PERSONID
00030A            FIRSTNAME
     A* cols 30-34 length, 35 data type, 36-37 decimals, 38 usage
00040A            AGE            3S 0
00050A            SALARY         9P 2
00060A            HIREDATE      10L
00070A            STARTTIME      8T
00080A            CREATED       26Z
00090A            NOTES        100A  B
00100A            BINFLD         9B 0
00110A            FLOATFLD       8F
     A* col 29 R takes the field definition from the referenced file
00120A            REFFIELD  R
     A* K marks a key field
00130A          K PERSONID
00140A          K LASTNAME
